<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<package xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/packaging/2015/06/nuspec.xsd">
  <metadata>
    <id>redaxa</id>
    <version>0.6.20</version>
    <title>Redaxa</title>
    <authors>Aurelio Avila</authors>
    <owners>AurelioAvila</owners>
    <requireLicenseAcceptance>false</requireLicenseAcceptance>
    <licenseUrl>https://github.com/AurelioAvila/redaxa/blob/main/LICENSE</licenseUrl>
    <projectUrl>https://redaxa.getcertsprint.com/</projectUrl>
    <iconUrl>https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/AurelioAvila/redaxa@main/src-tauri/icons/32x32.png</iconUrl>
    <summary>Review sensitive data and prepare redacted prompts before sharing</summary>
    <description>Redaxa helps review prompts for possible sensitive data and prepare a redacted copy before sharing with an AI tool. Inspect findings rather than assuming that every secret or personal detail will be detected.

Prompt checks in the Windows app and web app use the Redaxa backend. Free checks in the separate browser extension run inside the browser; accounts with an active plan use the service. This package installs the Windows app, not the extension.

Eligible Windows plans also include focused reviews of public GitHub repositories. The packaged desktop repository engine runs locally, retrieves repository data from GitHub and can make network requests for optional dependency checks. Do not assume that every operation is offline or that possible findings prove an active credential or a complete vulnerability audit. Features, account requirements and limits depend on the current plan; consult the official website and privacy policy.

The application is proprietary. Its viewable repository does not grant an open-source license.

This package downloads the official signed Windows x64 installer for version 0.6.20. Installation is machine-wide and requires administrator access. Microsoft Edge WebView2 Runtime is supplied as a shared prerequisite. The package does not request prompt checks, repository scans or changes to the browser.</description>
    <releaseNotes>Routine maintenance update. https://github.com/AurelioAvila/redaxa/releases/tag/v0.6.20</releaseNotes>
    <copyright>2026 Aurelio Avila</copyright>
    <tags>redaxa prompt-redaction pii privacy credentials security windows admin</tags>
    <packageSourceUrl>https://github.com/AurelioAvila/redaxa/tree/main/packaging/chocolatey</packageSourceUrl>
    <docsUrl>https://github.com/AurelioAvila/redaxa/blob/main/README.md</docsUrl>
    <bugTrackerUrl>https://github.com/AurelioAvila/redaxa/issues</bugTrackerUrl>
    <dependencies>
      <dependency id="webview2-runtime" />
    </dependencies>
  </metadata>
  <files>
    <file src="tools\*.ps1" target="tools" />
  </files>
</package>
